David: Congratulations! That''s wonderful.
Mia: Thank you. We''d like to invite you to the wedding. A formal invitation will come by post.
David: I''d be honoured to come. When and where is it?
Mia: It''s on the second Saturday in June, at the Garden Hotel.
David: Lovely. Is there anything special I should wear?
Mia: It''s quite a formal occasion, so please wear a suit.
David: Of course. Should I bring a gift?
Mia: A small present is always welcome, but your good wishes matter most.
David: I''ll be there for sure. Please pass on my best wishes to your sister.', 'Mia 告诉 David 她姐姐下个月结婚,想邀请他参加婚礼,正式请柬会邮寄过去;婚礼在六月第二个星期六、花园酒店;这是正式场合,请穿西装;送小礼物当然好,但最重要的是祝福;David 一定会到,并请代向她姐姐致意。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is Mia''s exciting news?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Her sister is getting married.","She has won a competition.","She is moving overseas.","She has bought a new house."]},{"q":"How will the invitation be sent?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["By phone call.","By post.","Through a friend.","On the day itself."]},{"q":"When is the wedding?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The second Saturday in June.","The first Sunday in July.","The last Friday in May.","New Year''s Eve."]},{"q":"What does Mia ask David to wear?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["A fancy costume.","A suit.","Something warm.","A school uniform."]},{"q":"What does Mia say matters most?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["An expensive gift.","Arriving very early.","David''s good wishes.","Bringing flowers."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U2', 'fltrp');
Emma: I''d like to, but I don''t know where the best place to stand is.
Leo: The main street near the square is perfect. The dragon dance passes right there.
Emma: A dragon dance? That sounds exciting. How early should we get there?
Leo: Quite early. The parade attracts huge crowds, so good spots fill up fast.
Emma: All right. Shall we meet at nine outside the bookshop?
Leo: Nine is fine. Wear something warm — we''ll be standing for a while.
Emma: Good point. Will there be music too?
Leo: Yes, drums and gongs all the way. The audience always joins in.
Emma: I can''t wait. See you at nine.', 'Leo 问 Emma 明天去不去看新年巡游;Emma 想去但不知最佳观看点;Leo 说广场旁的大街最好,舞龙正好经过那里;要早点去,因为巡游吸引大批人群,好位置很快被占;两人约九点在书店外见面;Leo 提醒穿暖和点,要站很久;一路上有锣鼓,观众也会一起参与;Emma 很期待。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What are Leo and Emma going to watch?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The New Year parade.","A football game.","A fireworks show by the river.","A book fair."]},{"q":"Where is the best place to stand?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Outside Emma''s home.","The main street near the square.","On the school playground.","Beside the river bank."]},{"q":"Why should they get there early?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["The parade ends very early.","The bookshop closes at nine.","Huge crowds fill the good spots fast.","It is going to rain."]},{"q":"Where will they meet?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["At the square gate.","By the river.","At the Garden Hotel.","Outside the bookshop."]},{"q":"What does Leo tell Emma to wear?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Something warm.","A bride''s dress.","A Batman costume.","A school uniform."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U2', 'fltrp');
Tom: Good idea. Why don''t we hold a small party in the classroom?
Sara: Perfect. We can decorate the room and prepare a card for everyone to sign.
Tom: What about a gift? He has taught us for three years.
Sara: I was thinking of a book of poetry. He loves reading.
Tom: He''ll like that. Should we also order a cake?
Sara: Yes, a small one. And we can ask a few parents to help.
Tom: Great. When shall we have it?
Sara: On the last Friday afternoon, after the final lesson.
Tom: I''ll tell the others. It''ll be a lovely surprise for him.', 'Sara 说 Lee 老师学期末就要退休,大家该为他做点什么;Tom 提议在教室办个小派对;Sara 同意,可以布置教室、准备一张卡片让大家签名;说到礼物,Lee 老师教了他们三年;Sara 想送一本诗集,因为他爱读书;Tom 觉得好,还可订个小蛋糕,并请几位家长帮忙;派对定在最后一个周五下午、最后一节课后;Tom 去通知其他人,这会是给老师的惊喜。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Why are Sara and Tom planning a party?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["It is Tom''s birthday.","The term has just started.","Their teacher Mr Lee is retiring.","They won a competition."]},{"q":"Where will they hold the party?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["At a restaurant.","In the school hall.","By the river.","In the classroom."]},{"q":"What gift does Sara suggest?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["A book of poetry.","A red lantern.","A football.","A box of mooncakes."]},{"q":"When will they have the party?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["On the first Monday morning.","On the last Friday afternoon.","On New Year''s Eve.","During the lunch break."]},{"q":"What does Tom say the party will be for Mr Lee?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["A hard test.","A boring meeting.","A lovely surprise.","A long lecture."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U2', 'fltrp');

